   "description": "List, search, read, create, fork, update, export or delete this workspace's chats. Inspect file candidates,\nreferences, permission rules and child runs. Revert a turn's changes with conversationId, turnId and direction.\nExport writes Markdown in the workspace. Oversized results return a JSON file reference.",
